<mxCell id="11" value="Employee Leave Management System  |  Full Architecture  |  Django 4.2 + React 18 + PostgreSQL 15" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1B2A3B;strokeColor=#1B2A3B;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="10" width="1560" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="12" value="REAL-LIFE FLOW: Dhruv (Employee) applies for 3-day Casual Leave  | [1] Browser opens React app  | [2] POST /api/login/ -&gt; JWT access_token issued (15 min)  | [3] ApplyLeaveForm -&gt; POST /api/leave-requests/ + Bearer token  | [4] JWTAuthentication validates token -&gt; LeaveRequestView runs 4 validations  | [5] Django saves LeaveRequest(status=pending) in PostgreSQL  | [6] Manager Rahul logs in -&gt; PATCH /approve/ -&gt; transaction.atomic() -&gt; used_days += 3  | [7] Dhruv sees Approved, balance 12 -&gt; 9 days" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F9A825;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fontColor=#5D4037;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="75" width="1560" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="13" value="LAYER 1  --  BROWSER / CLIENT  (Chrome/Firefox  |  HTTP requests to Vercel/Railway)" style="swimlane;startSize=30;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1E3A8A;align=left;horizontal=1;swimlaneLine=1;arcSize=4;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="165" width="1560" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
